        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "0e9e8c5b-0608-3547-89d0-d85af8c6f952",
                "word": "moi-même",
                "pos": "pron",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bb366907-da45-38d0-be25-b5e00e624fc0",
                        "entry_id": "0e9e8c5b-0608-3547-89d0-d85af8c6f952",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Moi comme le sujet naturellement ou directement responsable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d2169d45-6d71-4e74-bde6-abb31da471e5",
                                "sense_id": "bb366907-da45-38d0-be25-b5e00e624fc0",
                                "text": "Où devait s’arrêter le convoi qui nous emportait ? Assurément la troupe ne le savait guère, puisque je ne le savais pas moi-même."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "07595a5e-4396-4ccd-8d86-0f44c1d16a37",
                                "sense_id": "bb366907-da45-38d0-be25-b5e00e624fc0",
                                "text": "Parlez-lui demain matin, ou je le ferai moi-même, si vous le préférez."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c6db0dd6-c595-317c-bc1b-d15f908a0c3c",
                        "entry_id": "0e9e8c5b-0608-3547-89d0-d85af8c6f952",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Moi comme l’objet, et aussi comme soit le sujet, le possesseur ou le créateur."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "77aacf5b-c817-4845-b5ff-023d3c24c27d",
                                "sense_id": "c6db0dd6-c595-317c-bc1b-d15f908a0c3c",
                                "text": "C’est une peinture de moi-même, et les copies ne doivent pas être meilleures que l’original."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8bb6baad-f1fb-492e-8716-930868ab5315",
                                "sense_id": "c6db0dd6-c595-317c-bc1b-d15f908a0c3c",
                                "text": "Mais le sujet de mes peines étant fort récent, et le sentiment de ma douleur fort vif, peut-être ai-je trop parlé de moi-même."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "98b6016b-f8c6-457a-9926-3dcb8d59660d",
                                "sense_id": "c6db0dd6-c595-317c-bc1b-d15f908a0c3c",
                                "text": "Aujourd’hui que vous me traitez comme elles, que je ne peux plus l’ignorer, je dois au public, à mes amis, à moi-même, de suivre ce parti nécessaire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4961893b-aead-4b9f-a9cc-526cccc19f55",
                                "sense_id": "c6db0dd6-c595-317c-bc1b-d15f908a0c3c",
                                "text": "Ce disant, me voilà rendu en toute innocence à la première personne du singulier, adorable personne. Chassez le moi-même, il revient au galop."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b781870c-013d-4e66-af8c-3b0b0c4dd8ec",
                                "sense_id": "c6db0dd6-c595-317c-bc1b-d15f908a0c3c",
                                "text": "J’ai réussi à emporter en cachette un appareil. J’ai fait quelques photos de moi-même et de la nature pour montrer ce que je ressentais pendant cette période-là."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "57749d17-4347-411e-b3e7-a2166ed29c50",
                        "source_entry_id": "0e9e8c5b-0608-3547-89d0-d85af8c6f952",
                        "target_lang_word": "myself",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "myself",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "423445cd-fb31-3cd3-956f-38da13d99857",
                                        "entry_id": "ab7667f5-0624-307f-9f80-7f0e5c4d460f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Me, as direct or indirect object the speaker as the object of a verb or preposition, when the speaker is also the subject."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pronoun",
                                            "reflexive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c83f9be5-8450-4f6a-9756-489b51a5c744",
                                                "sense_id": "423445cd-fb31-3cd3-956f-38da13d99857",
                                                "text": "I taught myself."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b4ab0b3-deec-4b94-aa4f-aa753e8381d2",
                                                "sense_id": "423445cd-fb31-3cd3-956f-38da13d99857",
                                                "text": "(I) don’t think much of your new car, myself."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62a5e23c-f9b8-43a3-8316-b920d9293a4c",
                                                "sense_id": "423445cd-fb31-3cd3-956f-38da13d99857",
                                                "text": "Thinks I to myself, “Sol, you're run off your course again. This is a rich man's summer ‘cottage’ and if you don't look out there's likely to be some nice, lively dog taking an interest in your underpinning.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "282fe366-c8b9-44ea-a605-b32c767ddfa3",
                                                "sense_id": "423445cd-fb31-3cd3-956f-38da13d99857",
                                                "text": "“If you were a little bit kinder to yourself today, or if you gained insight, if you had an ‘Aha’ like, ‘Oh, man, I really do talk to myself the way my mom talked to me,’ or you identify a childhood wound … all of that is a form of reparenting,” she said."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f4fc4d58-5623-38a9-9a0f-0ca28b31e5b5",
                                        "entry_id": "ab7667f5-0624-307f-9f80-7f0e5c4d460f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personally, for my part; used in apposition to I, sometimes for simple emphasis and sometimes with implicit exclusion of any others performing the activity described."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a38218a-679e-4cc1-b0e8-632f4c4da9c0",
                                                "sense_id": "f4fc4d58-5623-38a9-9a0f-0ca28b31e5b5",
                                                "text": "I myself have witnessed the event."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75d3e491-c7bb-3060-8f50-cb1e6c0ee442",
                                        "entry_id": "ab7667f5-0624-307f-9f80-7f0e5c4d460f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In my normal state of body or mind."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0dc031a7-ed0d-4c0f-87e0-2687267b9fb7",
                                                "sense_id": "75d3e491-c7bb-3060-8f50-cb1e6c0ee442",
                                                "text": "I feel like myself."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bc0873e4-a4ab-35f0-8f9e-17aa5f947c75",
                                        "entry_id": "ab7667f5-0624-307f-9f80-7f0e5c4d460f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Me, as the object of a verb or preposition without a reflexive trigger. Sometimes used for intensifying the pronoun of oneself."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "proscribed"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f704aaf1-7eef-4495-8dc8-c73e7554340a",
                                                "sense_id": "bc0873e4-a4ab-35f0-8f9e-17aa5f947c75",
                                                "text": "Give the ball to John or myself."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "557eec69-3198-3596-a473-11c2d5508df4",
                                        "entry_id": "ab7667f5-0624-307f-9f80-7f0e5c4d460f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "I (as the subject of a verb)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "proscribed"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6481302-6b62-4774-a0c2-a15f76733b34",
                                                "sense_id": "557eec69-3198-3596-a473-11c2d5508df4",
                                                "text": "My wife and myself want to go on vacation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfe47b6d-fc30-442d-8256-4bd08752051e",
                                                "sense_id": "557eec69-3198-3596-a473-11c2d5508df4",
                                                "text": "And my selfe have knowen a Gentleman, a chiefe officer of our crowne, that by right and hope of succession (had he lived unto it) was to inherit above fifty thousand crownes a yeere good land[…]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bb351ea-1842-4f0b-9693-a63459e0292e",
                                                "sense_id": "557eec69-3198-3596-a473-11c2d5508df4",
                                                "text": "Myself am confident that an ointment of it is one of the best remedies for a scabby head that is."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6122b569-3021-3c65-8ea7-399bfe17b453",
                                        "entry_id": "ab7667f5-0624-307f-9f80-7f0e5c4d460f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "my name is..."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "India",
                                            "Pakistan",
                                            "nonstandard"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64b77201-18a9-430e-b4d2-32797fd74867",
                                                "sense_id": "6122b569-3021-3c65-8ea7-399bfe17b453",
                                                "text": "Myself John."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
